OL,3,ACan Trump really pay $5,000 to every
OL,4,AAmerican adult?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has offered
OL,7,Fevery adult American $5,000 (#3,700) if
OL,8,FRepublicans win November's midterm
OL,9,Felections, but it is unclear how such a
OL,10,Fplan would be funded and whether it is
OL,11,Flegal.
OL,13,FHis remarks prompted raucous applause
OL,14,Ffrom supporters at a party convention
OL,15,Fon Wednesday night, although Democrats
OL,16,Flabelled it an "empty promise".
OL,18,FTrump also told the Republican
OL,19,Fconference that the money would have to
OL,20,Fbe spent in the US, but it is unclear
OL,21,Fhow that would be monitored.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
