OL,3,APilot warned Amazon cargo plane going
OL,4,Atoo fast before deadly crash, data
OL,5,Ashows
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Boeing 767-300's landing speed was
OL,8,F158 knots (292km/h), which experts have
OL,9,Fnoted was on the high end.
OL,11,FThe NTSB is leading the investigation
OL,12,Finto the crash that killed five people
OL,13,Fand injured five more.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
